      "content": "wait, why are you talking about goblins? lol. i'm just trying to get the science right for this report. \n\ncan you just skip the stories and explain the math/physics a bit more clearly? also, i'm really stuck on these weird, sharp spikes in the salinity readings. they happen so fast and don't match the temp changes at all. it's like the hardware is just glitching out or something is messing with the signal. does that sound like typical sensor noise or is there something else i should be looking for?",
